(1566794, 208107, 35804, '<td valign="top">OH my goodness! I hope someone got this poor dog some help! I know I wouldn''t want to be the one to pull all those quills out..youch! Hopefully this was a lesson learned.  : }</td>', 'OH my goodness! I hope someone got this poor dog some help! I know I wouldn''t want to be the one to pull all those quills out..youch! Hopefully this was a lesson learned.  : }', '2005-07-27 12:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
