(1566800, 207415, 38032, '<td valign="top">the title is remarkably ambiguous ... The color is great ... The composition is hurt by the fact that the screwdriver gets confused at the tip.  Overall nice image - I like the dark reflections. 7</td>', 'the title is remarkably ambiguous ... The color is great ... The composition is hurt by the fact that the screwdriver gets confused at the tip.  Overall nice image - I like the dark reflections. 7', '2005-07-27 12:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1566801, 208827, 38032, '<td valign="top">cool - very nice might consider a color adjustment to get some yello out.<br/>other than that -really cool withthe hair flying!  8</td>', 'cool - very nice might consider a color adjustment to get some yello out.other than that -really cool withthe hair flying!  8', '2005-07-27 12:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1566803, 209466, 38032, '<td valign="top">nice - 7</td>', 'nice - 7', '2005-07-27 12:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1566806, 207660, 36333, '<td valign="top">Classic stock shot, but well executed.</td>', 'Classic stock shot, but well executed.', '2005-07-27 12:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1566807, 209352, 38032, '<td valign="top">It might just be me but I always think plastic stuff is less effective in photographs.  Unfortunately, everthing''s plastic now-  everything lasts forever in a landfill after breaking within 2 years!<br/>Sorry- off topic - um, I would consider composing this shot differently to make a stronger statement - since I''ve rattled on I''ll give you a 6 for listening.</td>', 'It might just be me but I always think plastic stuff is less effective in photographs.  Unfortunately, everthing''s plastic now-  everything lasts forever in a landfill after breaking within 2 years!Sorry- off topic - um, I would consider composing this shot differently to make a stronger statement - since I''ve rattled on I''ll give you a 6 for listening.', '2005-07-27 12:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1566808, 209524, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and creative. I really like the colors and the concept.  I do wish however that the brushes were bigger and more prominent in the picture.  I don''t much care for the multi-colored border.  Using all the colors in the border distracts more than adds.  It is not needed.  Keep up the good work.  8</td>', 'Very interesting and creative. I really like the colors and the concept.  I do wish however that the brushes were bigger and more prominent in the picture.  I don''t much care for the multi-colored border.  Using all the colors in the border distracts more than adds.  It is not needed.  Keep up the good work.  8', '2005-07-27 12:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1566809, 209506, 36333, '<td valign="top">I find the background a little distracting.  Perhaps the lighting could be a bit brighter on the foreground subject? Also I think you could have made more use of the knife as a strong linear element, and perhaps a less centered composition. Nice colours in the peppers though.</td>', 'I find the background a little distracting.  Perhaps the lighting could be a bit brighter on the foreground subject? Also I think you could have made more use of the knife as a strong linear element, and perhaps a less centered composition. Nice colours in the peppers though.', '2005-07-27 12:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1566810, 209589, 41375, '<td valign="top">I think that it would been more elegant if it would been darker.</td>', 'I think that it would been more elegant if it would been darker.', '2005-07-27 12:15:11.000000', NULL, 1);
