(1566822, 207377, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, good DOF.  I like the pattern and the lines.  Good job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice composition, good DOF.  I like the pattern and the lines.  Good job and good luck in the challenge.', '2005-07-27 12:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
