(1567020, 209590, 3102, '<td valign="top">Remember that there''s much more to DP Challenge than just "meeting the challenge."  Yes, this meets the challenge in that there are "tools of the trade," but I''m afraid there appears to have been very little thought put into the aesthetics of the shot.  The harsh lighting, and overall blurry composition need a little work :)</td>', 'Remember that there''s much more to DP Challenge than just "meeting the challenge."  Yes, this meets the challenge in that there are "tools of the trade," but I''m afraid there appears to have been very little thought put into the aesthetics of the shot.  The harsh lighting, and overall blurry composition need a little work :)', '2005-07-27 13:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
