(1567425, 209341, 3669, '<td valign="top">This is a nicely composed picture.  I do feel, however, that this would have looked better in B&amp;W.  The colors kind of clash.   The lighting is nice with good shadows.</td>', 'This is a nicely composed picture.  I do feel, however, that this would have looked better in B&W.  The colors kind of clash.   The lighting is nice with good shadows.', '2005-07-27 15:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
