(1567429, 209145, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very true!!  I''m really not crazy about the colored light that was used in this picture.  It really doesn''t highlight the subject very well.  Perhaps getting a little closer to the subject and make your picture bigger would put more emphasis on the brain where you can see it better.</td>', 'Very true!!  I''m really not crazy about the colored light that was used in this picture.  It really doesn''t highlight the subject very well.  Perhaps getting a little closer to the subject and make your picture bigger would put more emphasis on the brain where you can see it better.', '2005-07-27 15:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567430, 208775, 41129, '<td valign="top">real feeling of power in this shot,,, welldone</td>', 'real feeling of power in this shot,,, welldone', '2005-07-27 15:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567432, 209132, 41129, '<td valign="top">lol</td>', 'lol', '2005-07-27 15:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567435, 209330, 40355, '<td valign="top">Alas, the garage opening is too washed out...I''ve had this same problem before.  Something to keep in mind, be wary of, when shooting indoors-to-out like this.</td>', 'Alas, the garage opening is too washed out...I''ve had this same problem before.  Something to keep in mind, be wary of, when shooting indoors-to-out like this.', '2005-07-27 15:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567436, 208336, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  Vivid focus and shows good texture.  B&amp;W is very fitting here, of course.  Nice to see someone using the spinning wheel and in proper costume.  Good job and hope you are scoring well in the challenge.  I''m giving it a 10</td>', 'Very nice photo.  Vivid focus and shows good texture.  B&W is very fitting here, of course.  Nice to see someone using the spinning wheel and in proper costume.  Good job and hope you are scoring well in the challenge.  I''m giving it a 10', '2005-07-27 15:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567437, 207010, 21915, '<td valign="top">Hva you got the right challenge ?</td>', 'Hva you got the right challenge ?', '2005-07-27 15:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567438, 209416, 40355, '<td valign="top">The composition of this shot is well done, as is the lighting and its resulting flares and shadows.  And of course, there''s the title :)  Well done!</td>', 'The composition of this shot is well done, as is the lighting and its resulting flares and shadows.  And of course, there''s the title :)  Well done!', '2005-07-27 15:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
