(1567444, 207549, 41129, '<td valign="top">very different,,, cool</td>', 'very different,,, cool', '2005-07-27 15:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567446, 209115, 3669, '<td valign="top">Someone who didn''t know Nascar would not have a clue what is going on here.  Although I am very jealous of you being there in all the action as I love Nascar and have never personally been to a race, I''m not real crazy about this photo.  I think that there is a lot more fascinating pictures that could have been taken here.  The subject is too dark (skin tones are very red) and doesn''t clearly show what they are doing.</td>', 'Someone who didn''t know Nascar would not have a clue what is going on here.  Although I am very jealous of you being there in all the action as I love Nascar and have never personally been to a race, I''m not real crazy about this photo.  I think that there is a lot more fascinating pictures that could have been taken here.  The subject is too dark (skin tones are very red) and doesn''t clearly show what they are doing.', '2005-07-27 15:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567452, 209349, 37234, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I can mentally qualify the vehicle as a tool of the trade for astronauts. No dock for my opinion on how well this one fits the challenge, thoughk, as I can your viewpoint. It''s a great photo only marred by the two "hairs", or whatever they are.</td>', 'I''m not sure I can mentally qualify the vehicle as a tool of the trade for astronauts. No dock for my opinion on how well this one fits the challenge, thoughk, as I can your viewpoint. It''s a great photo only marred by the two "hairs", or whatever they are.', '2005-07-27 15:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567455, 209650, 40884, '<td valign="top">The white balance looks off. I''m guessing it may have been intentional, but whiter ivories would have worked better for me. Very nice composition, by the way.</td>', 'The white balance looks off. I''m guessing it may have been intentional, but whiter ivories would have worked better for me. Very nice composition, by the way.', '2005-07-27 15:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
