(1567801, 208445, 3669, '<td valign="top">Creative idea for the challenge.  My question is...what is a wrench doing in a wine glass?  Anyway, it makes for a cool effect (the bubbles).  I reallly like the color and how it plays in the glass especially at the stem.  Handle of the wrench is a little over exposed.  All that together...I give it an 8</td>', 'Creative idea for the challenge.  My question is...what is a wrench doing in a wine glass?  Anyway, it makes for a cool effect (the bubbles).  I reallly like the color and how it plays in the glass especially at the stem.  Handle of the wrench is a little over exposed.  All that together...I give it an 8', '2005-07-27 18:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
