(1567808, 207649, 24454, '<td valign="top">I never cease to be awed by these captures!!!    Mid-air. . . sharp and clear. . . stop action.   It''s just amazing!</td>', 'I never cease to be awed by these captures!!!    Mid-air. . . sharp and clear. . . stop action.   It''s just amazing!', '2005-07-27 18:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
