(1567812, 207217, 29156, '<td valign="top">great colors and texture</td>', 'great colors and texture', '2005-07-27 18:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567814, 208107, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmygosh.   This makes me want to cry.    I hope you said in your notes that he was okay after this.   This is the saddest thing I''ve seen.   Poor baby!!!!!!!!</td>', 'Ohmygosh.   This makes me want to cry.    I hope you said in your notes that he was okay after this.   This is the saddest thing I''ve seen.   Poor baby!!!!!!!!', '2005-07-27 18:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567819, 209092, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is very good.   It looks like a magazine advertisement picture.   So crisp and sharp with that great gradient background.   Surveying instruments aren''t the most interesting of subject to be in a photograph, but this is techinicallyso  perfect, and in fact is technically the best shot I''ve seen so far.   Great job.  10</td>', 'This is very good.   It looks like a magazine advertisement picture.   So crisp and sharp with that great gradient background.   Surveying instruments aren''t the most interesting of subject to be in a photograph, but this is techinicallyso  perfect, and in fact is technically the best shot I''ve seen so far.   Great job.  10', '2005-07-27 18:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567821, 208524, 40718, '<td valign="top">too many pics in this challenge have no composition.  I like this one.</td>', 'too many pics in this challenge have no composition.  I like this one.', '2005-07-27 18:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567827, 209543, 3669, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorite places that we went to visit during our Oregon trip last summer.  I''m not sure I like the sepia or yellow tone of this picture.  I do believe that this is a good canidate for selective desaturation...to desaturate everything but the cheese blocks.  By the way, if it weren''t for the title, I or anyone else would really know what this picture was specifically about.  The blocks could also be butter...or do they make butter too?  Hmm.  Ok this is enough..LOL  I give you a 6</td>', 'This was one of my favorite places that we went to visit during our Oregon trip last summer.  I''m not sure I like the sepia or yellow tone of this picture.  I do believe that this is a good canidate for selective desaturation...to desaturate everything but the cheese blocks.  By the way, if it weren''t for the title, I or anyone else would really know what this picture was specifically about.  The blocks could also be butter...or do they make butter too?  Hmm.  Ok this is enough..LOL  I give you a 6', '2005-07-27 18:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567828, 209668, 40718, '<td valign="top">I''ll give you credit for attempted composition, but without the title we would have no idea what it was...</td>', 'I''ll give you credit for attempted composition, but without the title we would have no idea what it was...', '2005-07-27 18:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567829, 209233, 38476, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, rich colors. The writing on the neck makes me think of an auction immediately, &amp; that gives a nice twist to the photo. Good job - 8.</td>', 'Nice composition, rich colors. The writing on the neck makes me think of an auction immediately, & that gives a nice twist to the photo. Good job - 8.', '2005-07-27 18:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567830, 209312, 29440, '<td valign="top">Good example of DOF.   I wish that there were more tools in the photo</td>', 'Good example of DOF.   I wish that there were more tools in the photo', '2005-07-27 18:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567831, 209380, 24454, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.   Simple, great feel to it with the sepia tones.    One of my favorites.  9 (only because there seems to be a little grain around the windows --- or else it would be a 10).</td>', 'I really like this one.   Simple, great feel to it with the sepia tones.    One of my favorites.  9 (only because there seems to be a little grain around the windows --- or else it would be a 10).', '2005-07-27 18:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567835, 209535, 40718, '<td valign="top">OK, finally a pic worth something.  I''ve been disappointed so far in this challenge with people taking things too literally and not working on composition or "the art" of it all.  This is the first 10 I''ve seen.  Possibly worthy of top 3 in a mediocre field.</td>', 'OK, finally a pic worth something.  I''ve been disappointed so far in this challenge with people taking things too literally and not working on composition or "the art" of it all.  This is the first 10 I''ve seen.  Possibly worthy of top 3 in a mediocre field.', '2005-07-27 18:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567837, 209524, 24454, '<td valign="top">Nice and colorful.  Refreshingly different from the others.   I like it a lot.</td>', 'Nice and colorful.  Refreshingly different from the others.   I like it a lot.', '2005-07-27 18:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567838, 209666, 40718, '<td valign="top">I prefer it if all the subjects are in focus,  looks a little soft on the left and right.</td>', 'I prefer it if all the subjects are in focus,  looks a little soft on the left and right.', '2005-07-27 18:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567839, 209317, 3669, '<td valign="top">This is not a bad photo.  I just feel that the DOF is a little narrow.  The focus appears to be on the tension control dial...I would like to see more of the machine sharpe.  The button, thread and thimble look good.  I think a little bit more could be cropped from the top.</td>', 'This is not a bad photo.  I just feel that the DOF is a little narrow.  The focus appears to be on the tension control dial...I would like to see more of the machine sharpe.  The button, thread and thimble look good.  I think a little bit more could be cropped from the top.', '2005-07-27 18:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567841, 209423, 19333, '<td valign="top">One coronita for me too!!! :P</td>', 'One coronita for me too!!! :P', '2005-07-27 18:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567843, 209610, 19333, '<td valign="top">Nice pic, but I don''t see any tool here. Sorry.</td>', 'Nice pic, but I don''t see any tool here. Sorry.', '2005-07-27 18:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1567844, 208058, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice...I like the stop motion of him working.  The greese and soot are definately realistic.  Great in B&amp;W.   9</td>', 'Nice...I like the stop motion of him working.  The greese and soot are definately realistic.  Great in B&W.   9', '2005-07-27 18:17:33.000000', NULL, 1);
