(1567924, 208829, 38476, '<td valign="top">The car itself is in an interesting position &amp; I think the position you worked from when you took the photo is great too. One of the questions I have about this photo is whether the lighting improves the shot or not. It looks like it was taken in early morning or in the evening &amp; those are generally good times because of the unusual shades of light. However, that''s not the case here - there''s just a general darkening of the photo.<br/> <br/>Maybe there was an effect you were going for &amp; I just missed it..., but again, good job on the angle of the photograph.</td>', 'The car itself is in an interesting position & I think the position you worked from when you took the photo is great too. One of the questions I have about this photo is whether the lighting improves the shot or not. It looks like it was taken in early morning or in the evening & those are generally good times because of the unusual shades of light. However, that''s not the case here - there''s just a general darkening of the photo. Maybe there was an effect you were going for & I just missed it..., but again, good job on the angle of the photograph.', '2005-07-27 18:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
