(1567971, 209270, 3669, '<td valign="top">The yellow hue is rather unappealing.  I would have liked to see more color in this picture.  Perhaps not necessarily with the products, but maybe adding a colorful flower, washcloth, or shower sponge.</td>', 'The yellow hue is rather unappealing.  I would have liked to see more color in this picture.  Perhaps not necessarily with the products, but maybe adding a colorful flower, washcloth, or shower sponge.', '2005-07-27 19:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
