(1568105, 208472, 38476, '<td valign="top">Great find - love the symmetry of the back-to-back boats!<br/> <br/>(If only that could have been emphasized more. Maybe a closer shot centering on just the backs of the boats; as if one was a mirror image of the other...)</td>', 'Great find - love the symmetry of the back-to-back boats! (If only that could have been emphasized more. Maybe a closer shot centering on just the backs of the boats; as if one was a mirror image of the other...)', '2005-07-27 19:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
