(1568573, 208292, 40128, '<td valign="top">nice colors. may smoothing the crumples on the left?</td>', 'nice colors. may smoothing the crumples on the left?', '2005-07-27 23:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568574, 208854, 31115, '<td valign="top">The crop is off.</td>', 'The crop is off.', '2005-07-27 23:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568576, 208653, 31115, '<td valign="top">Cool.</td>', 'Cool.', '2005-07-27 23:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568577, 209232, 40128, '<td valign="top">nice bird! sharp shot!</td>', 'nice bird! sharp shot!', '2005-07-27 23:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568578, 208961, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. Is that a crop issue on the sliver of white on the top right hand corner?</td>', 'Nice picture. Is that a crop issue on the sliver of white on the top right hand corner?', '2005-07-27 23:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568580, 209349, 30881, '<td valign="top">The water and ripples in foreground is excellent. Mist and haze can sometimes work for you or against you, imo this time it worked against you. 7</td>', 'The water and ripples in foreground is excellent. Mist and haze can sometimes work for you or against you, imo this time it worked against you. 7', '2005-07-27 23:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568585, 209607, 30881, '<td valign="top">Sorry I''m not really sure what you were trying to achieve with this image It doesn''t create any interest or curiosity for me</td>', 'Sorry I''m not really sure what you were trying to achieve with this image It doesn''t create any interest or curiosity for me', '2005-07-27 23:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568588, 207867, 33672, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Great comp and idea. needs to be crisper.</td>', 'I really like this. Great comp and idea. needs to be crisper.', '2005-07-27 23:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568591, 208969, 36981, '<td valign="top">I love the textures here, as well as the colors and composition.  Congrats on a great image!</td>', 'I love the textures here, as well as the colors and composition.  Congrats on a great image!', '2005-07-27 23:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568592, 209416, 36981, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition &amp; lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful composition & lighting.', '2005-07-27 23:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568594, 208083, 36981, '<td valign="top">Such simple tools, so beautifully photographed.  Congrats!</td>', 'Such simple tools, so beautifully photographed.  Congrats!', '2005-07-27 23:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568599, 208445, 30881, '<td valign="top">I had to keep coming back to this one-I already gave it a 10 I just didn''t know what to comment on. <br/>This would work great for a feature in Oprahs magazine. Top ten tools for women, or Tips and tricks for the handywoman. Beautifully done. My compliments!</td>', 'I had to keep coming back to this one-I already gave it a 10 I just didn''t know what to comment on. This would work great for a feature in Oprahs magazine. Top ten tools for women, or Tips and tricks for the handywoman. Beautifully done. My compliments!', '2005-07-27 23:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568600, 208961, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Met the Challenge (I consider hands in this trade a tool - thus I see 2 toolS).  Criticism; I like the b/w however perhaps in color the ''tool(s)'' may have been more discernible.  If I could clearly see the tools AND that left fore ''something'' were not there I would have given a 9.  Perhaps a slightly tighter crop may have been better.  A different angle, perhaps even getting down to ground level in this situation.  I was glad to see a shearer - original.</td>', '8 - Met the Challenge (I consider hands in this trade a tool - thus I see 2 toolS).  Criticism; I like the b/w however perhaps in color the ''tool(s)'' may have been more discernible.  If I could clearly see the tools AND that left fore ''something'' were not there I would have given a 9.  Perhaps a slightly tighter crop may have been better.  A different angle, perhaps even getting down to ground level in this situation.  I was glad to see a shearer - original.', '2005-07-27 23:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568601, 209535, 30881, '<td valign="top">Just Great!  B&amp;W when taken properly is excellent for showing lighting contrasts. Would have not cropped quite so tightly. I gave it a 9<br/></td>', 'Just Great!  B&W when taken properly is excellent for showing lighting contrasts. Would have not cropped quite so tightly. I gave it a 9', '2005-07-27 23:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568602, 209658, 36981, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of this image, but I think it needs better focus, sharpening and less distracting background.<br/> <br/>I really wish the border was not there.  I dislike most borders to begin with, but this one in particular seems to add nothing, and distracts to a degree that it was the first thing I noticed.</td>', 'I like the concept of this image, but I think it needs better focus, sharpening and less distracting background. I really wish the border was not there.  I dislike most borders to begin with, but this one in particular seems to add nothing, and distracts to a degree that it was the first thing I noticed.', '2005-07-27 23:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568604, 206601, 36981, '<td valign="top">Larger, please!  I''m sure you''re probably sick of hearing that.  I like the concept, but perhaps a more interesting title would tell me how that is a tool of the trade, or who would use it as one.</td>', 'Larger, please!  I''m sure you''re probably sick of hearing that.  I like the concept, but perhaps a more interesting title would tell me how that is a tool of the trade, or who would use it as one.', '2005-07-27 23:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568607, 208830, 30881, '<td valign="top">Texture and lighting on back wall is just great Nice sharp shadow from the fork "10" Just hope enough people notice this one. Seems if there aren''t bells whistle and ribbons nobody takes notice. Deserves to be a top 3</td>', 'Texture and lighting on back wall is just great Nice sharp shadow from the fork "10" Just hope enough people notice this one. Seems if there aren''t bells whistle and ribbons nobody takes notice. Deserves to be a top 3', '2005-07-27 23:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568610, 208354, 36981, '<td valign="top">Love the concept and the stop motion, and the composition.  I need to see it a little larger to tell more about whether it''s in focus - perhaps it needs a little sharpening?</td>', 'Love the concept and the stop motion, and the composition.  I need to see it a little larger to tell more about whether it''s in focus - perhaps it needs a little sharpening?', '2005-07-27 23:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568613, 209182, 36981, '<td valign="top">Great image!  I like the concept and the shadow on the left.  I''m sure you''ve heard about the size -- I''m sure that with the appropriate size (larger) you''d have done much better.  I''d like to see this with the shovel &amp; hat off to the right, showing the full shadow of the components.</td>', 'Great image!  I like the concept and the shadow on the left.  I''m sure you''ve heard about the size -- I''m sure that with the appropriate size (larger) you''d have done much better.  I''d like to see this with the shovel & hat off to the right, showing the full shadow of the components.', '2005-07-27 23:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568615, 208405, 36981, '<td valign="top">I love the colors &amp; the composition; I wish some bit (either the boy or the crayons) were in sharper focus so that my eyes could latch onto something.</td>', 'I love the colors & the composition; I wish some bit (either the boy or the crayons) were in sharper focus so that my eyes could latch onto something.', '2005-07-27 23:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568618, 209199, 30881, '<td valign="top">Good subject matter, good lighting nice shadow, however I would have preferred just one item in front of circle- perhaps on a 45 way over in the corner. Blue and green are conflicting and causing too much eye distraction. "8"</td>', 'Good subject matter, good lighting nice shadow, however I would have preferred just one item in front of circle- perhaps on a 45 way over in the corner. Blue and green are conflicting and causing too much eye distraction. "8"', '2005-07-27 23:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568622, 207010, 36981, '<td valign="top">I wish this were larger.  If I could see it more clearly it might be that there would be a stronger connection to the challenge (you might want to use your title if the connection isn''t obvious), or a more interesting image.  The lights look like they might be beautiful.</td>', 'I wish this were larger.  If I could see it more clearly it might be that there would be a stronger connection to the challenge (you might want to use your title if the connection isn''t obvious), or a more interesting image.  The lights look like they might be beautiful.', '2005-07-27 23:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568625, 207867, 36981, '<td valign="top">I lilke this image, but I would have like it a lot more without the frame.  I try to ignore frames, which I dislike generally, but for this mimimalist type of image it is simply too powerful for me to stop looking at.</td>', 'I lilke this image, but I would have like it a lot more without the frame.  I try to ignore frames, which I dislike generally, but for this mimimalist type of image it is simply too powerful for me to stop looking at.', '2005-07-27 23:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568628, 208107, 36981, '<td valign="top">Oh, I hope this isn''t real!  Bumped up two points just for the capture.  Hope he''s okay!</td>', 'Oh, I hope this isn''t real!  Bumped up two points just for the capture.  Hope he''s okay!', '2005-07-27 23:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568630, 206897, 36981, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  I would have preferred it larger &amp; without the frame, but I''m not taking off points ...</td>', 'I really like this.  I would have preferred it larger & without the frame, but I''m not taking off points ...', '2005-07-27 23:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568633, 208490, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Met the Challenge (I consider hands in this ''trade'' a definite tool - thus I see at least 2 toolS).  This photograph has a certain ''feel'' to it that I can''t describe sufficiently; a little dramatic, or intense - not sure.  I think it is the sepia? effect, can''t quite place it.  Criticism; I would like to see that forearm either more focussed (though I know that the hand on the left may be ''lost'' then) or perhaps it cropped a little tighter there at the bottom.  Also, more of the hands, on the right and the left, in the frame would make this a better picture in my opinion.  Good character in this photograph.</td>', '8 - Met the Challenge (I consider hands in this ''trade'' a definite tool - thus I see at least 2 toolS).  This photograph has a certain ''feel'' to it that I can''t describe sufficiently; a little dramatic, or intense - not sure.  I think it is the sepia? effect, can''t quite place it.  Criticism; I would like to see that forearm either more focussed (though I know that the hand on the left may be ''lost'' then) or perhaps it cropped a little tighter there at the bottom.  Also, more of the hands, on the right and the left, in the frame would make this a better picture in my opinion.  Good character in this photograph.', '2005-07-27 23:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568638, 207987, 37234, '<td valign="top">A funny title!</td>', 'A funny title!', '2005-07-27 23:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568640, 209662, 37234, '<td valign="top">Docking 7 points for not using 5A''s.<br/>Just kidding! Good photo! 7</td>', 'Docking 7 points for not using 5A''s.Just kidding! Good photo! 7', '2005-07-27 23:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568660, 207073, 35530, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture. My vote for a ribbon.</td>', 'Beautiful capture. My vote for a ribbon.', '2005-07-27 23:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568663, 207243, 36981, '<td valign="top">I love this image - beautiful colors &amp; composition.  I wish the photographer were actually at the camera, and I truly wish the frame weren''t there, but a 9 nonetheless.</td>', 'I love this image - beautiful colors & composition.  I wish the photographer were actually at the camera, and I truly wish the frame weren''t there, but a 9 nonetheless.', '2005-07-27 23:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568667, 206825, 36981, '<td valign="top">I love the tones in this image, as well as the concept and composition.  Well done!</td>', 'I love the tones in this image, as well as the concept and composition.  Well done!', '2005-07-27 23:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568671, 209199, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Met the Challenge.  I like this shot it is very clean and captures the ''feel'' of the compass well.  The colors are simple and there is no clashing and given the subject I do not think anything bolder is required as it would make the silver ''metal'' of the compass ''fade''.  Criticism;  I would like to see even more sharpness on the compass, more emphasis somehow on it.  Maybe a tighter crop taking out more of the top, but I realise you would then lose the rule there.  Maybe turning that upside down to have the numbers and lines, as that would still fit in with the style/angles of the others.  Perhaps more play on the shadow, not sure.</td>', '8 - Met the Challenge.  I like this shot it is very clean and captures the ''feel'' of the compass well.  The colors are simple and there is no clashing and given the subject I do not think anything bolder is required as it would make the silver ''metal'' of the compass ''fade''.  Criticism;  I would like to see even more sharpness on the compass, more emphasis somehow on it.  Maybe a tighter crop taking out more of the top, but I realise you would then lose the rule there.  Maybe turning that upside down to have the numbers and lines, as that would still fit in with the style/angles of the others.  Perhaps more play on the shadow, not sure.', '2005-07-27 23:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568672, 206897, 35530, '<td valign="top">Simplicity at it''s finest. Nice effort.</td>', 'Simplicity at it''s finest. Nice effort.', '2005-07-28 00:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568674, 207248, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Met the Challenge.  This is a busy photograph but has a lot of character and the colors are bold and apt.  Criticism;  Perhaps a little less ''clutter'', maybe more of a focus on the clown, yet still incorporating some more of the ''tools''.  The dog is a good character ''edge'' and the angle and pose of it I like.  The flowers also add to the character.  I think a differet crop, slightly sharper angle (closer to the mirror) - not sure. I have to assume this is fairly ''candid'' but if it is not, then more attention to the arrangement of the ''tools'' would have made this a better photograph in my opinion.  Original.</td>', '8 - Met the Challenge.  This is a busy photograph but has a lot of character and the colors are bold and apt.  Criticism;  Perhaps a little less ''clutter'', maybe more of a focus on the clown, yet still incorporating some more of the ''tools''.  The dog is a good character ''edge'' and the angle and pose of it I like.  The flowers also add to the character.  I think a differet crop, slightly sharper angle (closer to the mirror) - not sure. I have to assume this is fairly ''candid'' but if it is not, then more attention to the arrangement of the ''tools'' would have made this a better photograph in my opinion.  Original.', '2005-07-28 00:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568677, 209272, 24599, '<td valign="top">are you serious?</td>', 'are you serious?', '2005-07-28 00:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568678, 209639, 35530, '<td valign="top">Did your model know this was going into a "tool" challenge? If I put a shot like this of my better half in with tools, I would have gotten a tool (hammer) to the back of my head.</td>', 'Did your model know this was going into a "tool" challenge? If I put a shot like this of my better half in with tools, I would have gotten a tool (hammer) to the back of my head.', '2005-07-28 00:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568679, 208158, 21816, '<td valign="top">Very good photo! I don''t know if a rain maker is a trade though is it? :) Well done!</td>', 'Very good photo! I don''t know if a rain maker is a trade though is it? :) Well done!', '2005-07-28 00:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568680, 207341, 35530, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. The lighting needs some work.</td>', 'Nice concept. The lighting needs some work.', '2005-07-28 00:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568681, 206981, 21816, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! Well done!</td>', 'Nice capture! Well done!', '2005-07-28 00:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568682, 209639, 21816, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo!</td>', 'Excellent photo!', '2005-07-28 00:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568684, 208830, 21816, '<td valign="top">I like the mood captured here!</td>', 'I like the mood captured here!', '2005-07-28 00:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568685, 208107, 15242, '<td valign="top">Odd, I got photos of this dog emailed to me the other day with the quills all over it???</td>', 'Odd, I got photos of this dog emailed to me the other day with the quills all over it???', '2005-07-28 00:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568687, 208445, 35530, '<td valign="top">Unusually (in a good way) take on the challenge. Lighting is perfect and the colors make the whole shot pop out. Nice job. 9</td>', 'Unusually (in a good way) take on the challenge. Lighting is perfect and the colors make the whole shot pop out. Nice job. 9', '2005-07-28 00:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568696, 209343, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Met the Challenge.  I like the feel of this shot and the colors.  Criticism; In my opinion, it is perhaps a little too dark - especially at the top.  I would like to see a finer focus on the hook(s - almost missed the other one) and perhaps a tighter crop (bottom).  Nice and simple though.</td>', '8 - Met the Challenge.  I like the feel of this shot and the colors.  Criticism; In my opinion, it is perhaps a little too dark - especially at the top.  I would like to see a finer focus on the hook(s - almost missed the other one) and perhaps a tighter crop (bottom).  Nice and simple though.', '2005-07-28 00:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568700, 209607, 35530, '<td valign="top">Great profession and nice props. The lighting doesn''t seem to do it too much justice.</td>', 'Great profession and nice props. The lighting doesn''t seem to do it too much justice.', '2005-07-28 00:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568705, 209286, 35530, '<td valign="top">I know that guy...he''s Rick Shaw.</td>', 'I know that guy...he''s Rick Shaw.', '2005-07-28 00:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568706, 208367, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Met the Challenge.  The jury is still out on the ''viability'' of this ''trade'' however for now it is a ''pass''.  Good attention to detail save for one thing (and I may be mistaken) but the last word written would be ''mood'' and thus the pen there.  Criticism; given that, and for other reasons, in my opinion this would be a better photograph if the angle were a lot sharper, from the page ''up''.   A crisper focus on the pen/calligraphy would be better for me.</td>', '7 - Met the Challenge.  The jury is still out on the ''viability'' of this ''trade'' however for now it is a ''pass''.  Good attention to detail save for one thing (and I may be mistaken) but the last word written would be ''mood'' and thus the pen there.  Criticism; given that, and for other reasons, in my opinion this would be a better photograph if the angle were a lot sharper, from the page ''up''.   A crisper focus on the pen/calligraphy would be better for me.', '2005-07-28 00:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568708, 209439, 35530, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but what''s going on with the background?</td>', 'Nice shot, but what''s going on with the background?', '2005-07-28 00:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568712, 209599, 30881, '<td valign="top">Well laid out image. Could have been just a touch sharper..</td>', 'Well laid out image. Could have been just a touch sharper..', '2005-07-28 00:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568713, 209103, 35530, '<td valign="top">Lighting is awesome in this shot.</td>', 'Lighting is awesome in this shot.', '2005-07-28 00:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568718, 207415, 35530, '<td valign="top">The reflections of the screws makes this a much more interesting shot than it forst appears</td>', 'The reflections of the screws makes this a much more interesting shot than it forst appears', '2005-07-28 00:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568721, 207103, 35530, '<td valign="top">Idea was very good. The image seems to be over-enlarged.</td>', 'Idea was very good. The image seems to be over-enlarged.', '2005-07-28 00:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568723, 208336, 35530, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2005-07-28 00:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568724, 207549, 35530, '<td valign="top">Huh!!!</td>', 'Huh!!!', '2005-07-28 00:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568725, 208367, 30061, '<td valign="top">Love the idea, and the composition.  My one criticism is the choice of font - it''s very easily recognized, and makes it obvious that the page was printed and not actually written by hand.  There are tons of free handwriting fonts available for download that wouldn''t be so easily recognized.  I love the creativity, though!</td>', 'Love the idea, and the composition.  My one criticism is the choice of font - it''s very easily recognized, and makes it obvious that the page was printed and not actually written by hand.  There are tons of free handwriting fonts available for download that wouldn''t be so easily recognized.  I love the creativity, though!', '2005-07-28 00:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568726, 207576, 35530, '<td valign="top">Simple, elegant and well lit. Nice.</td>', 'Simple, elegant and well lit. Nice.', '2005-07-28 00:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568727, 207660, 30061, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  I love the lines of the glasses and the clean white background.  Great shot! 9</td>', 'Great composition.  I love the lines of the glasses and the clean white background.  Great shot! 9', '2005-07-28 00:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568730, 207217, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Met the Challenge.  I like the capture of the spray coupled with the light.  Criticism;  I would like to see said capture in more detail.  I do not know if you have adjusted the color of the little light , but if you have, in my opinion I think a different color would have worked better to highlight the metal, perhaps blue.  I would like to see a sharper focus on the drill?, and as I said more detail on the spray.  The background is bland, and in my opinion needs ''something'' to lift the subject up, but you may not have had any choice there.  Original.</td>', '7 - Met the Challenge.  I like the capture of the spray coupled with the light.  Criticism;  I would like to see said capture in more detail.  I do not know if you have adjusted the color of the little light , but if you have, in my opinion I think a different color would have worked better to highlight the metal, perhaps blue.  I would like to see a sharper focus on the drill?, and as I said more detail on the spray.  The background is bland, and in my opinion needs ''something'' to lift the subject up, but you may not have had any choice there.  Original.', '2005-07-28 00:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568731, 208058, 35530, '<td valign="top">Good capture. I like the slight motion blur of the hammer.</td>', 'Good capture. I like the slight motion blur of the hammer.', '2005-07-28 00:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568735, 209500, 35530, '<td valign="top">Ouch!</td>', 'Ouch!', '2005-07-28 00:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568736, 207986, 35530, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Great props and good lighting.</td>', 'Nice composition. Great props and good lighting.', '2005-07-28 00:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568738, 209045, 35530, '<td valign="top">This is nice in B&amp;W. Focus seems a little soft.</td>', 'This is nice in B&W. Focus seems a little soft.', '2005-07-28 00:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568742, 209105, 33068, '<td valign="top">Love the composition, lighting and tone.  Well done.</td>', 'Love the composition, lighting and tone.  Well done.', '2005-07-28 00:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568744, 207549, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Met the Challenge - just.  I perceive this as A tool of the trade, but the jury is out on the display clothing, as they could be a tool too.  Criticism;  should have utilized the title to emphasize what you are trying to convey here as the ''tools'' - dummies (not that I think titles need to explain a photograph necessarily, I just think you ''wasted'' yours).  Angle could be better and the colors richer and a different crop, would all make this a better photograph in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Met the Challenge - just.  I perceive this as A tool of the trade, but the jury is out on the display clothing, as they could be a tool too.  Criticism;  should have utilized the title to emphasize what you are trying to convey here as the ''tools'' - dummies (not that I think titles need to explain a photograph necessarily, I just think you ''wasted'' yours).  Angle could be better and the colors richer and a different crop, would all make this a better photograph in my opinion.', '2005-07-28 00:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568748, 207547, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Met the Challenge.  I like the concept of this shot.  Criticism; for me, it is too ''raw''.  More detail paid to aspects such as the backdrop(?) far right (including the color and ironing creases), the ''cloth'' left fore, placement of the painting, etc.  A sharper angle and a key point of focus (perhaps on the brushes?) and a different choice of fabrics would make this a better photograph for me.</td>', '7 - Met the Challenge.  I like the concept of this shot.  Criticism; for me, it is too ''raw''.  More detail paid to aspects such as the backdrop(?) far right (including the color and ironing creases), the ''cloth'' left fore, placement of the painting, etc.  A sharper angle and a key point of focus (perhaps on the brushes?) and a different choice of fabrics would make this a better photograph for me.', '2005-07-28 00:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568752, 209348, 35530, '<td valign="top">Super presentation</td>', 'Super presentation', '2005-07-28 00:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568753, 208263, 35530, '<td valign="top">Nice effect and great cropping. Turns mundane objects into a work of art.</td>', 'Nice effect and great cropping. Turns mundane objects into a work of art.', '2005-07-28 00:51:05.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1568757, 208258, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Met the Challenge.  I like this shot and think it captures the character and feel of a blacksmith''s shop well.  Criticism; I would like to see richer colors (the fire, the red brick, the black etc).  I would like to see more definition on the metal tools.  I just noticed the reflection/sparkle on the water in the barrel far left - ''if only'' you could have incorporated that more as that is good, but I am sure that would be difficult.  It made me think about the water (which could also be classed as a tool in this trade) and for me, adds more character to this shot.  Very original.  Good capture of a now rare trade.  Challenge well met.</td>', '8 - Met the Challenge.  I like this shot and think it captures the character and feel of a blacksmith''s shop well.  Criticism; I would like to see richer colors (the fire, the red brick, the black etc).  I would like to see more definition on the metal tools.  I just noticed the reflection/sparkle on the water in the barrel far left - ''if only'' you could have incorporated that more as that is good, but I am sure that would be difficult.  It made me think about the water (which could also be classed as a tool in this trade) and for me, adds more character to this shot.  Very original.  Good capture of a now rare trade.  Challenge well met.', '2005-07-28 00:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568758, 209272, 35530, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, but I don''t see how it fits the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely shot, but I don''t see how it fits the challenge.', '2005-07-28 00:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568759, 209355, 36762, '<td valign="top">excellent choice of trade. Are you a dressage trainer/ rider? Only suggestion I have is maybe try different lighting on the saddle. Otherwise I really like the photo.</td>', 'excellent choice of trade. Are you a dressage trainer/ rider? Only suggestion I have is maybe try different lighting on the saddle. Otherwise I really like the photo.', '2005-07-28 00:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568763, 209535, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Met the Challenge.  Well captured use of tools.  Good character here.  Black and white works well, perhaps sepia may have had more ''effect'', not sure.  Criticism; a tighter crop, or just losing that background left ''something''.  A different angle (though I know you would sacrifice the ''character'') but incorporating/emphasizing the tools (including his hands - especially at rear) would make this a better photograph in my opinion.  Original and a good capture of a true skilled trade(sman).</td>', '8 - Met the Challenge.  Well captured use of tools.  Good character here.  Black and white works well, perhaps sepia may have had more ''effect'', not sure.  Criticism; a tighter crop, or just losing that background left ''something''.  A different angle (though I know you would sacrifice the ''character'') but incorporating/emphasizing the tools (including his hands - especially at rear) would make this a better photograph in my opinion.  Original and a good capture of a true skilled trade(sman).', '2005-07-28 00:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568765, 207649, 35530, '<td valign="top">This should have been in the sports challenge.</td>', 'This should have been in the sports challenge.', '2005-07-28 00:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568768, 209560, 37234, '<td valign="top">a little underexposed</td>', 'a little underexposed', '2005-07-28 00:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568769, 207243, 35530, '<td valign="top">Stunning scenery.</td>', 'Stunning scenery.', '2005-07-28 00:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568772, 209268, 37234, '<td valign="top">nicely done</td>', 'nicely done', '2005-07-28 00:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568777, 208827, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Met the Challenge (I consider hands in this trade a ''tool'', thus I see 2 toolS).  This photograph has the potential of being very unique.  Criticism; I would like to have seen you really ''capture'' that ''flying hair'' (though I am sure it would be difficult if not impossible, camera dependent).  I think a tighter crop at the bottom and perhaps even a touch on the right, primarily to ''erase'' the dark mark on the man''s ear.  That does add some to the character, but in my opinion this would be a ''cleaner'' photograph without it.  I like how you captured the barber but I think too much of his fingers are in the frame, perhaps even blurring the background more may make the clippers and ''customer'' more prevalent.  Original.</td>', '8 - Met the Challenge (I consider hands in this trade a ''tool'', thus I see 2 toolS).  This photograph has the potential of being very unique.  Criticism; I would like to have seen you really ''capture'' that ''flying hair'' (though I am sure it would be difficult if not impossible, camera dependent).  I think a tighter crop at the bottom and perhaps even a touch on the right, primarily to ''erase'' the dark mark on the man''s ear.  That does add some to the character, but in my opinion this would be a ''cleaner'' photograph without it.  I like how you captured the barber but I think too much of his fingers are in the frame, perhaps even blurring the background more may make the clippers and ''customer'' more prevalent.  Original.', '2005-07-28 00:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568778, 208669, 37234, '<td valign="top">ok, i really don''t get this one. it seems your subject does not fit the challenge, although your secondary subject, if you want to call it that, might. i''m a little lost as to the direction this photo is supposed to take me.</td>', 'ok, i really don''t get this one. it seems your subject does not fit the challenge, although your secondary subject, if you want to call it that, might. i''m a little lost as to the direction this photo is supposed to take me.', '2005-07-28 00:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568779, 209475, 34425, '<td valign="top">love the warm tones of this image... very good lighting!</td>', 'love the warm tones of this image... very good lighting!', '2005-07-28 00:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568780, 208474, 35530, '<td valign="top">Great concept. Seems a little out of focus.</td>', 'Great concept. Seems a little out of focus.', '2005-07-28 00:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568784, 209439, 37234, '<td valign="top">you must have blown out the highlights on the trees really badly and tried to tone them down with levels? that''s the only reason i can come up with for the strong posterization effect in the branches. this photo is well conceived, but has pretty severe lighting problems.</td>', 'you must have blown out the highlights on the trees really badly and tried to tone them down with levels? that''s the only reason i can come up with for the strong posterization effect in the branches. this photo is well conceived, but has pretty severe lighting problems.', '2005-07-28 01:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568785, 208830, 35530, '<td valign="top">Stunning in it''s simplicity. You managed to capture the mood with the lighting.</td>', 'Stunning in it''s simplicity. You managed to capture the mood with the lighting.', '2005-07-28 01:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568786, 209405, 37234, '<td valign="top">so.... sprinklers are a tool of what trade now? LOL!!! Well, maybe "Future Firemen" would have been more apt a title. As it stands, I''m not quite sure it meets the challenge, but it''s a cute photo.</td>', 'so.... sprinklers are a tool of what trade now? LOL!!! Well, maybe "Future Firemen" would have been more apt a title. As it stands, I''m not quite sure it meets the challenge, but it''s a cute photo.', '2005-07-28 01:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568789, 209605, 35530, '<td valign="top">Too much clutter. Lacks a strong focal point.</td>', 'Too much clutter. Lacks a strong focal point.', '2005-07-28 01:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568794, 209539, 34425, '<td valign="top">very cute indeed... a welcome change from the serious "tools"! great colors too!</td>', 'very cute indeed... a welcome change from the serious "tools"! great colors too!', '2005-07-28 01:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568797, 209341, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Met the Challenge (just - the jury is out on the ''trade'' aspect).  I like this shot for its simplicity, colors and textures.  Criticism;  Although I just mentioned the colors, I do wonder how this would look in b/w.  I would like to see a finer focus on the thimble as well.  A slight ''rotate'' maybe left, to straighten this up as it seems a little crooked to me, though I know the fabric is ''straight''.  Maybe a lighter background or just a different color.  Perhaps a mirror could have worked well here, not sure.<br/>edit: sp<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-08-03 00:30:42.</i></td>', '7 - Met the Challenge (just - the jury is out on the ''trade'' aspect).  I like this shot for its simplicity, colors and textures.  Criticism;  Although I just mentioned the colors, I do wonder how this would look in b/w.  I would like to see a finer focus on the thimble as well.  A slight ''rotate'' maybe left, to straighten this up as it seems a little crooked to me, though I know the fabric is ''straight''.  Maybe a lighter background or just a different color.  Perhaps a mirror could have worked well here, not sure.edit: sp', '2005-07-28 01:04:23.000000', '2005-08-03 01:30:42.000000', 1),
(1568799, 209272, 37234, '<td valign="top">wrong challenge? or were you shooting for "tools for the bee''s trade"?</td>', 'wrong challenge? or were you shooting for "tools for the bee''s trade"?', '2005-07-28 01:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568800, 209458, 35530, '<td valign="top">FOCUS</td>', 'FOCUS', '2005-07-28 01:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568803, 209068, 37234, '<td valign="top">Wow! That''s an old one!</td>', 'Wow! That''s an old one!', '2005-07-28 01:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568804, 209601, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Met the Challenge.  I like this shot and the perspective.  Criticism; Whilst I would like to see a richer color on the spade?, it may blow the white out even more than it already is.  I would like to see either the focus further down the handles or else a tighter crop.  Perhaps just a sharp focus (or zoom) onto the tools, not sure.  More attention to the placement of the tools perhaps, as the shadows could be played on more in my opinion.  Creative though.</td>', '8 - Met the Challenge.  I like this shot and the perspective.  Criticism; Whilst I would like to see a richer color on the spade?, it may blow the white out even more than it already is.  I would like to see either the focus further down the handles or else a tighter crop.  Perhaps just a sharp focus (or zoom) onto the tools, not sure.  More attention to the placement of the tools perhaps, as the shadows could be played on more in my opinion.  Creative though.', '2005-07-28 01:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568806, 209439, 30791, '<td valign="top">thats actually an assault riffle, M16 i believe</td>', 'thats actually an assault riffle, M16 i believe', '2005-07-28 01:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568811, 207666, 35530, '<td valign="top">That explains the paint all over the place. Actually, this is a very appealing shot. The colors are great and it is well lit. The only fault I can see is your "self-portrait" in the bottle. You could have prevented this with a dab of paint to stop the reflection. Still a great shot.</td>', 'That explains the paint all over the place. Actually, this is a very appealing shot. The colors are great and it is well lit. The only fault I can see is your "self-portrait" in the bottle. You could have prevented this with a dab of paint to stop the reflection. Still a great shot.', '2005-07-28 01:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568814, 208292, 35530, '<td valign="top">I like the colors of the yarn. I think a different color background would have made this better.</td>', 'I like the colors of the yarn. I think a different color background would have made this better.', '2005-07-28 01:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568816, 209482, 35530, '<td valign="top">A little late for the sports challenge.</td>', 'A little late for the sports challenge.', '2005-07-28 01:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568817, 208107, 28710, '<td valign="top">Dog + Porcupine = One Unhappy Dog.<br/> <br/>I don''t have time to vote on this, sorry, but what a great picture! I wish I could have seen the porcupine! Was he naked?<br/> <br/>Alternate title? Know when to give up!<br/> <br/>Heh. Dogs are so dumb. Porcupines are neither a threat nor a source of food for a domesticated animal.</td>', 'Dog + Porcupine = One Unhappy Dog. I don''t have time to vote on this, sorry, but what a great picture! I wish I could have seen the porcupine! Was he naked? Alternate title? Know when to give up! Heh. Dogs are so dumb. Porcupines are neither a threat nor a source of food for a domesticated animal.', '2005-07-28 01:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568820, 209211, 35530, '<td valign="top">I like the title. Think I read the book.</td>', 'I like the title. Think I read the book.', '2005-07-28 01:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568821, 209355, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Met the Challenge.  Not sure if these belong to a real horse trainer or not but either way it fits the challenge.  The shot is very nice and clean.  I like the b/w.  Criticism; Maybe just sharper, a touch more ''contrast'', not sure.  The background works well and the ''scene'' is just ''mellow''.  I just noticed you cut off the tips of the straps with your frame, so maybe it might have been best to leave that off.  Not sure how this would have worked in color (given the seemingly ''shrubby'' background), but as I said, I do like it in b/w.  Nice lighting at the top of the ''tools''.</td>', '8 - Met the Challenge.  Not sure if these belong to a real horse trainer or not but either way it fits the challenge.  The shot is very nice and clean.  I like the b/w.  Criticism; Maybe just sharper, a touch more ''contrast'', not sure.  The background works well and the ''scene'' is just ''mellow''.  I just noticed you cut off the tips of the straps with your frame, so maybe it might have been best to leave that off.  Not sure how this would have worked in color (given the seemingly ''shrubby'' background), but as I said, I do like it in b/w.  Nice lighting at the top of the ''tools''.', '2005-07-28 01:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568823, 208258, 28710, '<td valign="top">Great shot. The lighting is a bit weird, but not really bad.</td>', 'Great shot. The lighting is a bit weird, but not really bad.', '2005-07-28 01:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1568824, 209661, 14181, '<td valign="top">A little too much backlighting.  I almost missed the lettering, and thus the meaning fof the title.  Otherwise, very good.</td>', 'A little too much backlighting.  I almost missed the lettering, and thus the meaning fof the title.  Otherwise, very good.', '2005-07-28 01:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
