(1569534, 207576, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great graphic quality.  The starkness really works. THe cherry amidst the cool whites and silvers has some real punch.</td>', 'Great graphic quality.  The starkness really works. THe cherry amidst the cool whites and silvers has some real punch.', '2005-07-28 10:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569535, 206981, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the dark shadowy image.  It''s almost womblike (very clever). The composition and position of the figure is really well done.   The light over her chest, hands and belly makes this a true work of art.</td>', 'I love the dark shadowy image.  It''s almost womblike (very clever). The composition and position of the figure is really well done.   The light over her chest, hands and belly makes this a true work of art.', '2005-07-28 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569537, 209661, 38725, '<td valign="top">I find the ''shine'' in the background a bit too distracting, otherwise nice shot.</td>', 'I find the ''shine'' in the background a bit too distracting, otherwise nice shot.', '2005-07-28 10:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569539, 207867, 15711, '<td valign="top">Simple and quite effective.  I think I might have liked it if the drill bits weren''t dead center.  The lighting bounces off of the edges of them quite nicely. The frame is a perfect addition.  8</td>', 'Simple and quite effective.  I think I might have liked it if the drill bits weren''t dead center.  The lighting bounces off of the edges of them quite nicely. The frame is a perfect addition.  8', '2005-07-28 10:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569541, 209299, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The sepia filter works well here. The angle of the shot is interesting and makes for a great composition. Maybe the figures are a touch too dark but overll - well done.</td>', 'Very nice. The sepia filter works well here. The angle of the shot is interesting and makes for a great composition. Maybe the figures are a touch too dark but overll - well done.', '2005-07-28 10:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569542, 209455, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice macro.  The detail and colrs are vividly displayed. Good one.</td>', 'Nice macro.  The detail and colrs are vividly displayed. Good one.', '2005-07-28 10:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569544, 209268, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice graphic capture.  I wonder if a dark background would have even given the yellow and silver more pop? The diagonal quality of this shot works well. 8</td>', 'Nice graphic capture.  I wonder if a dark background would have even given the yellow and silver more pop? The diagonal quality of this shot works well. 8', '2005-07-28 10:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569549, 209559, 38840, '<td valign="top">Semper Fi</td>', 'Semper Fi', '2005-07-28 10:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569550, 209524, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has a very playful edge to it. It''s as if the brushes are caught in mid stroke.  I like the colors against the black background.  Almost like a reverse Pollack!  I wonder if people are seeing that you spelled A-R-T? Very clever - I just noticed that myself upon second viewing.  8</td>', 'This has a very playful edge to it. It''s as if the brushes are caught in mid stroke.  I like the colors against the black background.  Almost like a reverse Pollack!  I wonder if people are seeing that you spelled A-R-T? Very clever - I just noticed that myself upon second viewing.  8', '2005-07-28 10:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569551, 209663, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice tight macro and good use of negative space.  I wish the needle had a skim of light over it.</td>', 'Nice tight macro and good use of negative space.  I wish the needle had a skim of light over it.', '2005-07-28 10:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569554, 209495, 15711, '<td valign="top">Grea DOF. Maybe the background is a tad busy.  Perhaps a single colored spool might have been less distracting.  The needle seems a bit overprocessed with sharpen.</td>', 'Grea DOF. Maybe the background is a tad busy.  Perhaps a single colored spool might have been less distracting.  The needle seems a bit overprocessed with sharpen.', '2005-07-28 10:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569557, 208975, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice tight macro. I love the shadow to the left of the blade.I might crop out the top third to make for a more appealing shape of the photo and I think it would still work as effectively.  I wish the light streak on the blade itself weren''t so blurred. :~(</td>', 'Nice tight macro. I love the shadow to the left of the blade.I might crop out the top third to make for a more appealing shape of the photo and I think it would still work as effectively.  I wish the light streak on the blade itself weren''t so blurred. :~(', '2005-07-28 10:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569562, 209641, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is one of the few staged studio type shots I like in this challenge.  I think the tipped bowl is why - it creates a little visual interest and isn''t what''s expected. The light and shadow is well done and black and white would be the only way to go with this image. Good use of dark background - it makes the items pop out at you. My only complaint is it''s a tad busy.  You might lose one or more item and I still think it would work.  I like the spatula being the tall straight "soldier" of the group.</td>', 'This is one of the few staged studio type shots I like in this challenge.  I think the tipped bowl is why - it creates a little visual interest and isn''t what''s expected. The light and shadow is well done and black and white would be the only way to go with this image. Good use of dark background - it makes the items pop out at you. My only complaint is it''s a tad busy.  You might lose one or more item and I still think it would work.  I like the spatula being the tall straight "soldier" of the group.', '2005-07-28 11:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569567, 206986, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is simple and the centered circle works in this instance.  I like the heart it creates on the page. Nice and uncomplicated capture. I might try to figure out a way to rid it of the yellow of the bright light at the top of the page since  it''s a tad harsh.</td>', 'This is simple and the centered circle works in this instance.  I like the heart it creates on the page. Nice and uncomplicated capture. I might try to figure out a way to rid it of the yellow of the bright light at the top of the page since  it''s a tad harsh.', '2005-07-28 11:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569569, 208969, 15711, '<td valign="top">Vivid red against the white. I wish the edge of the brush were in focus.  I love your use of negative space and the contrast of the color with the stark foreground.  Nicely shot. 8</td>', 'Vivid red against the white. I wish the edge of the brush were in focus.  I love your use of negative space and the contrast of the color with the stark foreground.  Nicely shot. 8', '2005-07-28 11:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569572, 209601, 15711, '<td valign="top">What makes this work better than any of the other implement shots is the angle. I love that you are on the ground looking straight up, creating a leading line to the sky.  The white may be a touch stark, but the shadows and the rusty tools more than make up for it.  The sky color is so vivid and is awesome against the other tones. This might even be cool in black and white. I think I''d crop out the right 20% and alleviate those pipes sticking out and then the tools wouldn''t be so dead center and those things sticking out wouldn''t be a distraction.</td>', 'What makes this work better than any of the other implement shots is the angle. I love that you are on the ground looking straight up, creating a leading line to the sky.  The white may be a touch stark, but the shadows and the rusty tools more than make up for it.  The sky color is so vivid and is awesome against the other tones. This might even be cool in black and white. I think I''d crop out the right 20% and alleviate those pipes sticking out and then the tools wouldn''t be so dead center and those things sticking out wouldn''t be a distraction.', '2005-07-28 11:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569574, 207109, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice simple use of negative space.  The shadow is interesting.  I might lose one side so that it''s not dead centered, although in this shot, it''s not totally unattractive to the eye. I might up the contrast on the plane just a bit to show more of it''s detailing.</td>', 'Nice simple use of negative space.  The shadow is interesting.  I might lose one side so that it''s not dead centered, although in this shot, it''s not totally unattractive to the eye. I might up the contrast on the plane just a bit to show more of it''s detailing.', '2005-07-28 11:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569577, 209593, 15711, '<td valign="top">The foreground is well shot - the background seems a tad too bright.  Maybe crop down to right above his hat.  Still a good use of sepia. Great urban shot. 7</td>', 'The foreground is well shot - the background seems a tad too bright.  Maybe crop down to right above his hat.  Still a good use of sepia. Great urban shot. 7', '2005-07-28 11:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569580, 208445, 15711, '<td valign="top">What an imaginative take on an ordinary atool. I love the magenta and the fact that you put it in a glass of effervescent liquid - the bubbles are a fun surprise. Nice diagonal quality to it. 8</td>', 'What an imaginative take on an ordinary atool. I love the magenta and the fact that you put it in a glass of effervescent liquid - the bubbles are a fun surprise. Nice diagonal quality to it. 8', '2005-07-28 11:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569581, 209218, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice use of contrast and negative space.  I wish the screw were in better focus. I love the blue and red combo.</td>', 'Nice use of contrast and negative space.  I wish the screw were in better focus. I love the blue and red combo.', '2005-07-28 11:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569583, 207611, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. Great imagination on this one!!</td>', 'Very interesting. Great imagination on this one!!', '2005-07-28 11:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569587, 209405, 21714, '<td valign="top">I really like the curves you have created with the hoses and water. They make the shot really interesting.</td>', 'I really like the curves you have created with the hoses and water. They make the shot really interesting.', '2005-07-28 11:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569588, 207074, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is really well shot.  Not too busy either.  The reflection on the left side makes the shot.  I love all of the circular elements - it creates a continuous  theme.  The grainy texture of the countertop adds a nice dimension to it.  I love the grayed sepia as well.  Very nice still life! 8</td>', 'This is really well shot.  Not too busy either.  The reflection on the left side makes the shot.  I love all of the circular elements - it creates a continuous  theme.  The grainy texture of the countertop adds a nice dimension to it.  I love the grayed sepia as well.  Very nice still life! 8', '2005-07-28 11:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569590, 207660, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity. Great use of light and you did a good job of angling it so it''s not boring or ordinary.</td>', 'I like the simplicity. Great use of light and you did a good job of angling it so it''s not boring or ordinary.', '2005-07-28 11:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569592, 207649, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW - great blue tones. I''d crop out part of the right so he''s not dead centered in the shot.  I could have even had more negative space on this one. Good stop action.</td>', 'WOW - great blue tones. I''d crop out part of the right so he''s not dead centered in the shot.  I could have even had more negative space on this one. Good stop action.', '2005-07-28 11:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569593, 209323, 21714, '<td valign="top">Nice exosure with fine details. I do feel that this shout could be made stronger with a different crop. The balance seems a bit off, but there''s a lot going for this one.</td>', 'Nice exosure with fine details. I do feel that this shout could be made stronger with a different crop. The balance seems a bit off, but there''s a lot going for this one.', '2005-07-28 11:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569595, 209364, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nicely cropped.  GOod use of macro. It''s amazing the color variations.  The black background is the perfect set up for the wrenches. Nice light with no hot spots. 8</td>', 'Nicely cropped.  GOod use of macro. It''s amazing the color variations.  The black background is the perfect set up for the wrenches. Nice light with no hot spots. 8', '2005-07-28 11:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569597, 207073, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the sparks shooting out. Great stop action capture. The blue and yellow work well as contrasting colors.</td>', 'I love the sparks shooting out. Great stop action capture. The blue and yellow work well as contrasting colors.', '2005-07-28 11:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569600, 209241, 15711, '<td valign="top">Good one.  The clarity of the oil dripping is really well done.  I wonder if you''d be able to appreciate it more with a white background?? The yellow makes a nice vivid contrast to the black.</td>', 'Good one.  The clarity of the oil dripping is really well done.  I wonder if you''d be able to appreciate it more with a white background?? The yellow makes a nice vivid contrast to the black.', '2005-07-28 11:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569601, 208367, 40667, '<td valign="top">great focal point~! i love the composition of the photo~! great job and good luck~!</td>', 'great focal point~! i love the composition of the photo~! great job and good luck~!', '2005-07-28 11:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
