(1569606, 208957, 21714, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot and I did pick up cameras hanging from nails on the wall too. This shot gives an insight into how things used to be (for me at least) and I don''t know if things still go on like this. You have told a story with this one and I like it a lot.</td>', 'I like this one a lot and I did pick up cameras hanging from nails on the wall too. This shot gives an insight into how things used to be (for me at least) and I don''t know if things still go on like this. You have told a story with this one and I like it a lot.', '2005-07-28 11:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569607, 209504, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the DOF in this one.  The old building in the back adds more to the story. This might be even more interesting of shot so you aren''t looking straight on at the old tractor. I love the colors  - not overdone - they seem quite natural.</td>', 'I love the DOF in this one.  The old building in the back adds more to the story. This might be even more interesting of shot so you aren''t looking straight on at the old tractor. I love the colors  - not overdone - they seem quite natural.', '2005-07-28 11:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
