(1569614, 209355, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus and use of the grayed sepia.  The background is a bit overexposed, but you might be able to work on that if you could spot edit.</td>', 'I like the soft focus and use of the grayed sepia.  The background is a bit overexposed, but you might be able to work on that if you could spot edit.', '2005-07-28 11:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
