(1569617, 209589, 30061, '<td valign="top">I''m giving this one a 10 - I''m not sure what attracted me to it, aside from the color, but I really like it.  It''s different than all of the other entries I''ve seen so far.  And, of course, I know how hard it is to get a good shot like this.  I like your depth of field - not being able to see the community cards is a good thing.  Constructive criticism - the background is noticeably grainy.  The foreground looks good and sharp, though.  Great shot!</td>', 'I''m giving this one a 10 - I''m not sure what attracted me to it, aside from the color, but I really like it.  It''s different than all of the other entries I''ve seen so far.  And, of course, I know how hard it is to get a good shot like this.  I like your depth of field - not being able to see the community cards is a good thing.  Constructive criticism - the background is noticeably grainy.  The foreground looks good and sharp, though.  Great shot!', '2005-07-28 11:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569618, 208258, 15711, '<td valign="top">This looks old world to me.  Like it was shot a long time ago. This has lots of leading lines.</td>', 'This looks old world to me.  Like it was shot a long time ago. This has lots of leading lines.', '2005-07-28 11:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
