(1569648, 208160, 40667, '<td valign="top">owch... eww... great photo, needs a manicure tho~! good luck, and great job~!</td>', 'owch... eww... great photo, needs a manicure tho~! good luck, and great job~!', '2005-07-28 11:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569649, 209406, 15711, '<td valign="top">Good close up. The diagonal quality is a nice touch. The light on the green adds a little pop to the photo.</td>', 'Good close up. The diagonal quality is a nice touch. The light on the green adds a little pop to the photo.', '2005-07-28 11:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569651, 209498, 21714, '<td valign="top">I find your subject and all the mid tones quite interesting, but I am not too keen on the composition. Something doesn''t look right to me. It looks either a bit too close or if you need to get even closer.</td>', 'I find your subject and all the mid tones quite interesting, but I am not too keen on the composition. Something doesn''t look right to me. It looks either a bit too close or if you need to get even closer.', '2005-07-28 11:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569653, 208864, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think this could be a tad more effective if you zoomed in and concentrated on the scissors and wool instead of showing the entire tiger''s face (although that is very well done for needlepoint). The scissors are slightly out of focus and I think that should be the main subject, not the image. But that''s just my opinion. Hope this is helpful.</td>', 'I think this could be a tad more effective if you zoomed in and concentrated on the scissors and wool instead of showing the entire tiger''s face (although that is very well done for needlepoint). The scissors are slightly out of focus and I think that should be the main subject, not the image. But that''s just my opinion. Hope this is helpful.', '2005-07-28 11:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569656, 209343, 40667, '<td valign="top">YES~! i was hoping this was coming... wow, 35% voted on and i couldn''t belive that i had not seen a photo directly related to fishing~! I love it~! great job, great focal point, great composition~!  i love this photo... it would have been in my favourites if i had thought to put it there b4 i wrote this long, and very true message~! I love this photo~! i truley hope you get the blue~! wonderfull job... wow~!</td>', 'YES~! i was hoping this was coming... wow, 35% voted on and i couldn''t belive that i had not seen a photo directly related to fishing~! I love it~! great job, great focal point, great composition~!  i love this photo... it would have been in my favourites if i had thought to put it there b4 i wrote this long, and very true message~! I love this photo~! i truley hope you get the blue~! wonderfull job... wow~!', '2005-07-28 11:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1569657, 207074, 34337, '<td valign="top">slightly pixelated, but great contrast.  Work on your photo quality a little, and you''ll have a perfect shot.  DPC has tutorials on how to do it best under the "Learn" menu at the top of the screen.</td>', 'slightly pixelated, but great contrast.  Work on your photo quality a little, and you''ll have a perfect shot.  DPC has tutorials on how to do it best under the "Learn" menu at the top of the screen.', '2005-07-28 11:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
