(1570682, 208775, 41091, '<td valign="top">Wow I didn''t like it at first, but really looking at it... it has one of those "anne oakley get your gun tough guy things" that honors the working man with worthiness and respect.  I love this.</td>', 'Wow I didn''t like it at first, but really looking at it... it has one of those "anne oakley get your gun tough guy things" that honors the working man with worthiness and respect.  I love this.', '2005-07-28 21:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
