(1570686, 208445, 40976, '<td valign="top">The purple background adds a very nice touch.  I would think that if the wrench is suppose to be the focus of the picture that it should be completely in focus.  The top of the wrench is OOF.  You probably planned it that way, so I won''t let it detract from your score.  Nice pic!</td>', 'The purple background adds a very nice touch.  I would think that if the wrench is suppose to be the focus of the picture that it should be completely in focus.  The top of the wrench is OOF.  You probably planned it that way, so I won''t let it detract from your score.  Nice pic!', '2005-07-28 21:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
