(1570765, 206825, 38476, '<td valign="top">Great lighting. Also good job picking out the subject of your photo (by focus &amp; positioning). Well done.</td>', 'Great lighting. Also good job picking out the subject of your photo (by focus & positioning). Well done.', '2005-07-28 22:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570767, 206826, 40386, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image, not sure if you softened it intentionally but it works here.  The only think I dont like is the side of the face and hair on the right side of the frame.</td>', 'This is a nice image, not sure if you softened it intentionally but it works here.  The only think I dont like is the side of the face and hair on the right side of the frame.', '2005-07-28 22:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570784, 208023, 38476, '<td valign="top">A number of things going on in this photo that compete with it''s purpose. Although my eyes see the "tools of the trade" first, they spend only a split-second there &amp; then are drawn straight to the number 2620 (dead center of the photo). While my mind is wondering what the number''s significance might be, my eyes are then drawn to the three unruly trees in the background &amp; I''m wondering what they have to do with the challenge...<br/> <br/>However, I think the position from which the photo was taken is great. Absolutely love the machinery that frames the right side of the shot. Great idea to include that!</td>', 'A number of things going on in this photo that compete with it''s purpose. Although my eyes see the "tools of the trade" first, they spend only a split-second there & then are drawn straight to the number 2620 (dead center of the photo). While my mind is wondering what the number''s significance might be, my eyes are then drawn to the three unruly trees in the background & I''m wondering what they have to do with the challenge... However, I think the position from which the photo was taken is great. Absolutely love the machinery that frames the right side of the shot. Great idea to include that!', '2005-07-28 22:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570787, 209422, 40386, '<td valign="top">On its own this image doesnt tell a story, if you had maybe included a few other tools, drill bits, screws, wood or whatever goes with this theme I think it would have been a better shot</td>', 'On its own this image doesnt tell a story, if you had maybe included a few other tools, drill bits, screws, wood or whatever goes with this theme I think it would have been a better shot', '2005-07-28 22:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570789, 209566, 40386, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but if you had maybe added a mirror and a few brushes and other bits and pieces, maybe a reflection in the mirror it would have been a much stronger picture</td>', 'Good idea, but if you had maybe added a mirror and a few brushes and other bits and pieces, maybe a reflection in the mirror it would have been a much stronger picture', '2005-07-28 22:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570794, 206844, 35530, '<td valign="top">What a crisp, gorgeous shot. It is such a shame that this doesn''t fit the challenge.</td>', 'What a crisp, gorgeous shot. It is such a shame that this doesn''t fit the challenge.', '2005-07-28 22:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570795, 209051, 35530, '<td valign="top">I remember those from Biology 101.</td>', 'I remember those from Biology 101.', '2005-07-28 22:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570799, 206981, 38476, '<td valign="top">Great photo, but a challenging title. What are the anatomic tools? the hands? the breasts? the belly? all of them together?<br/> <br/>And tools for what? If they''re for looking after the baby those three sets of tools have one purpose, if they''re for her lover it''s a whole different purpose...<br/> <br/>Maybe I''m making too big a deal of this (&amp; maybe I''m just being thick!), but I seem to be hung up on the tools thing...<br/> <br/>(Great photo though - did I mention that before? - texture, detail, lighting. Superb job!)</td>', 'Great photo, but a challenging title. What are the anatomic tools? the hands? the breasts? the belly? all of them together? And tools for what? If they''re for looking after the baby those three sets of tools have one purpose, if they''re for her lover it''s a whole different purpose... Maybe I''m making too big a deal of this (& maybe I''m just being thick!), but I seem to be hung up on the tools thing... (Great photo though - did I mention that before? - texture, detail, lighting. Superb job!)', '2005-07-28 22:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570803, 208474, 38476, '<td valign="top">Well composed photo, but seems a little washed out to me...</td>', 'Well composed photo, but seems a little washed out to me...', '2005-07-28 22:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570805, 209241, 38476, '<td valign="top">Hell! I wish my engine oil was that clean!</td>', 'Hell! I wish my engine oil was that clean!', '2005-07-28 22:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1570807, 207341, 38476, '<td valign="top">The angle &amp; the lighting highligh the flaws on the surface of this cello, which is a pity. Creative composition, though, &amp; nice lining up of the strings with the top frame of the photo.</td>', 'The angle & the lighting highligh the flaws on the surface of this cello, which is a pity. Creative composition, though, & nice lining up of the strings with the top frame of the photo.', '2005-07-28 22:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
