(1572311, 209310, 3669, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite understand the purpose of the other (white) bottles in this picture.  They seem to be out of place.  I do like the red against the white background.  Otherwise, technically well done and meets challenge.</td>', 'I don''t quite understand the purpose of the other (white) bottles in this picture.  They seem to be out of place.  I do like the red against the white background.  Otherwise, technically well done and meets challenge.', '2005-07-29 17:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
