(1572339, 209593, 3669, '<td valign="top">Humbling.   Good capture of this poor man.  I''m not sure that I like the sepia tone in this picture.  I think B&amp;W would have been better</td>', 'Humbling.   Good capture of this poor man.  I''m not sure that I like the sepia tone in this picture.  I think B&W would have been better', '2005-07-29 17:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1572342, 209523, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  The best out of the poker pictures.  Great DOF and lighting.  Excellent composition.  9</td>', 'Nicely done.  The best out of the poker pictures.  Great DOF and lighting.  Excellent composition.  9', '2005-07-29 17:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1572349, 209648, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very sweet picture.  I love it when I see dogs that are SO patient with children.  My only complaint...I wish that the picture was just a tad brighter. Doesn''t need much, but a little boost of contrast.</td>', 'Very sweet picture.  I love it when I see dogs that are SO patient with children.  My only complaint...I wish that the picture was just a tad brighter. Doesn''t need much, but a little boost of contrast.', '2005-07-29 17:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1572352, 209247, 3669, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF.  Good collection of tools.  B&amp;W is a good choice here.  My only complaint...I do not really like the measuring tape behind the sewing foot and needle.  Even just moving it to the left in the empty space would make the picture look more balanced composition-wise.  8</td>', 'Excellent DOF.  Good collection of tools.  B&W is a good choice here.  My only complaint...I do not really like the measuring tape behind the sewing foot and needle.  Even just moving it to the left in the empty space would make the picture look more balanced composition-wise.  8', '2005-07-29 17:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1572356, 209651, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice collection of baking tools.  I like the composition and colors.</td>', 'Nice collection of baking tools.  I like the composition and colors.', '2005-07-29 17:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1572358, 208367, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  Well put together and such a good idea.  I love the poem from what I can read of it.  Very creative and I like that.  Good job.  10</td>', 'Very nice composition.  Well put together and such a good idea.  I love the poem from what I can read of it.  Very creative and I like that.  Good job.  10', '2005-07-29 17:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1572364, 208360, 3669, '<td valign="top">Coming back for another look.  This is a nice picture...visually appealing.  Focus seems a bit soft, but doesn''t necessarily ruin the picture.</td>', 'Coming back for another look.  This is a nice picture...visually appealing.  Focus seems a bit soft, but doesn''t necessarily ruin the picture.', '2005-07-29 18:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1572367, 208503, 3669, '<td valign="top">I''m kind of surprised that there wasn''t more duct tape pictures in this challenge.  The composition is nice here on how you displayed the tape, but in B&amp;W, it is actually kind of hard to actually see what kind of tape it is.  Since duct tape is usually silver, I would have liked to see this in color.</td>', 'I''m kind of surprised that there wasn''t more duct tape pictures in this challenge.  The composition is nice here on how you displayed the tape, but in B&W, it is actually kind of hard to actually see what kind of tape it is.  Since duct tape is usually silver, I would have liked to see this in color.', '2005-07-29 18:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1572372, 208812, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed.  I like the quilt in the background.  Excellent lighting and focus.</td>', 'Nicely composed.  I like the quilt in the background.  Excellent lighting and focus.', '2005-07-29 18:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
