(1572430, 209348, 40490, '<td valign="top">Everything''s in focus, I like the set of colors in the image, small amount, but just enough.  Quite nice!  The positioning of everything is ideal and the border is effective. good job</td>', 'Everything''s in focus, I like the set of colors in the image, small amount, but just enough.  Quite nice!  The positioning of everything is ideal and the border is effective. good job', '2005-07-29 18:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
