(1572435, 209523, 40490, '<td valign="top">This is something I didn''t completely expect in this list of things, points for originality.  The aces are very clear and crisp.... just like the fingernails.  The background is blurred nicely and you can definetly still see the table in the background with ease.  Colors are good, I like this image.</td>', 'This is something I didn''t completely expect in this list of things, points for originality.  The aces are very clear and crisp.... just like the fingernails.  The background is blurred nicely and you can definetly still see the table in the background with ease.  Colors are good, I like this image.', '2005-07-29 18:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
