(1572440, 209238, 40490, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what you''re making here.... it looks like.... wood shavings?  At any rate, the woodshavings, or whatever, themselves, are very clear.  The color scheme is good for this image.  I can see the tools in the background, and although they''re not in focus, you can definetly tell they seem to be a ''behind the scenes'' sort of importance in this image.  Not bad :-)</td>', 'I''m not sure what you''re making here.... it looks like.... wood shavings?  At any rate, the woodshavings, or whatever, themselves, are very clear.  The color scheme is good for this image.  I can see the tools in the background, and although they''re not in focus, you can definetly tell they seem to be a ''behind the scenes'' sort of importance in this image.  Not bad :-)', '2005-07-29 18:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
