(1572448, 207532, 40490, '<td valign="top">If I were doing this, specific, prop, I wold have arranged the tools a bit better and tried to make it look like a commerical.  The colors are a bit dull and much of it is out of focus.  Meh, it''s okay...</td>', 'If I were doing this, specific, prop, I wold have arranged the tools a bit better and tried to make it look like a commerical.  The colors are a bit dull and much of it is out of focus.  Meh, it''s okay...', '2005-07-29 18:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1572451, 208419, 40490, '<td valign="top">*stares* ..... oh! it''s a guitar! Alrighty... quite nice.  I''m not sure if that far away was the best position for the good strings.  The light location is ver nice, however.  also, the back is kinda.... spotted.... and doesn''t look clean.  That doesn''t help the image very much.  If the camera were moved just a bit away then the image cropped and a couple of other things, I think I would have rated it higher...</td>', '*stares* ..... oh! it''s a guitar! Alrighty... quite nice.  I''m not sure if that far away was the best position for the good strings.  The light location is ver nice, however.  also, the back is kinda.... spotted.... and doesn''t look clean.  That doesn''t help the image very much.  If the camera were moved just a bit away then the image cropped and a couple of other things, I think I would have rated it higher...', '2005-07-29 18:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1572457, 206896, 40490, '<td valign="top">nice colors, although maybe a little polarized... you might have wanted that, however.  It looks relatively good, to be honest... uhm... yeah, good.</td>', 'nice colors, although maybe a little polarized... you might have wanted that, however.  It looks relatively good, to be honest... uhm... yeah, good.', '2005-07-29 18:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
