(1577232, 209454, 40521, '<td valign="top">Relevance to theme  2/3<br/>The theme was tools not tool<br/> <br/>Composition  2/3<br/>I had this at a 1 but am now bumping it to a 2. I like the angle of the tape measure. This grabs my eyes and takes them across the entire photo.<br/> <br/>Technical (Lighting ect)  1/2<br/>I like the blue tone of this shot. The thing I would have done different was ensure that there was no glare on the diamond plate, this distracts me quite a bit.<br/> <br/>Creativity  1/2<br/> <br/></td>', 'Relevance to theme  2/3The theme was tools not tool Composition  2/3I had this at a 1 but am now bumping it to a 2. I like the angle of the tape measure. This grabs my eyes and takes them across the entire photo. Technical (Lighting ect)  1/2I like the blue tone of this shot. The thing I would have done different was ensure that there was no glare on the diamond plate, this distracts me quite a bit. Creativity  1/2 ', '2005-08-01 02:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
