(1580919, 209406, 21714, '<td valign="top">I have asked myself what is that I like about this image so much, but I still don''t know why I like it so much. Probably connecting me to something I enjoyed doing.</td>', 'I have asked myself what is that I like about this image so much, but I still don''t know why I like it so much. Probably connecting me to something I enjoyed doing.', '2005-08-02 16:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1580923, 209332, 21714, '<td valign="top">I can almost smell them. Yeah, it''s amazing what these ingredients can do. They have always been a part of my life.</td>', 'I can almost smell them. Yeah, it''s amazing what these ingredients can do. They have always been a part of my life.', '2005-08-02 16:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1580927, 209238, 21714, '<td valign="top">When I was growing up, one of my uncles who is a carpenter was doing a lot of work at our place and one of the things I really enjoyed was wathing the ''rondhaa'' as we call it. I used to sit and watch the shapes the little pieces of wood were making. This image throws me back to my childhood. It''s your focus and presentation that does that.</td>', 'When I was growing up, one of my uncles who is a carpenter was doing a lot of work at our place and one of the things I really enjoyed was wathing the ''rondhaa'' as we call it. I used to sit and watch the shapes the little pieces of wood were making. This image throws me back to my childhood. It''s your focus and presentation that does that.', '2005-08-02 16:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1580932, 209255, 21714, '<td valign="top">Red Bull definitely is the drink. I still don''t understand how it works though. <br/>I have seen students pack Red Bull into their fridges before the exams. I didn''t do it myself. I definitely see what you have done in different ways.</td>', 'Red Bull definitely is the drink. I still don''t understand how it works though. I have seen students pack Red Bull into their fridges before the exams. I didn''t do it myself. I definitely see what you have done in different ways.', '2005-08-02 16:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1580947, 209466, 21714, '<td valign="top">There are things that I like about the image and there are things about it that make me ask questions. It looks to me like he''s not holding that guitar like he usually does. It looks like he''s been asked to do something.  It looks a bit unnatural. But again, he could be different. Still, in the image, the extended arm and how the guitar is cornered and his facial expression doesn''t give me the idea that he''s someone who enjoys that instrument. Maybe he''s a six strings magician, I don''t know .. just a few things I noticed myself.</td>', 'There are things that I like about the image and there are things about it that make me ask questions. It looks to me like he''s not holding that guitar like he usually does. It looks like he''s been asked to do something.  It looks a bit unnatural. But again, he could be different. Still, in the image, the extended arm and how the guitar is cornered and his facial expression doesn''t give me the idea that he''s someone who enjoys that instrument. Maybe he''s a six strings magician, I don''t know .. just a few things I noticed myself.', '2005-08-02 16:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
