(1581840, 208963, 37234, '<td valign="top">Great job on this one. I''m assuming I understand how you did it and will be interested to read your comments afterwords.</td>', 'Great job on this one. I''m assuming I understand how you did it and will be interested to read your comments afterwords.', '2005-08-03 00:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
