(1581851, 209648, 38411, '<td valign="top">Very Cute.</td>', 'Very Cute.', '2005-08-03 00:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1581853, 209593, 37234, '<td valign="top">I gave this shot a pretty good rating because I like y our choice of black and white and the light sepia/yellow tone. It''s perfect for the shot. This would be a much stronger photo without the border (the wide sides are a distraction for me) and the really blown out highlights in the background.</td>', 'I gave this shot a pretty good rating because I like y our choice of black and white and the light sepia/yellow tone. It''s perfect for the shot. This would be a much stronger photo without the border (the wide sides are a distraction for me) and the really blown out highlights in the background.', '2005-08-03 00:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1581858, 209299, 37234, '<td valign="top">Bumping up the second time around. This is a great pic, and is now in my top 2.</td>', 'Bumping up the second time around. This is a great pic, and is now in my top 2.', '2005-08-03 00:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1581859, 209524, 37234, '<td valign="top">One of my top 2 picks. This one is well done, interesting, and definately out of the box.</td>', 'One of my top 2 picks. This one is well done, interesting, and definately out of the box.', '2005-08-03 00:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1581860, 208410, 37234, '<td valign="top">One of my top 5 picks. Really great shot, I can''t think of what would have made it better.</td>', 'One of my top 5 picks. Really great shot, I can''t think of what would have made it better.', '2005-08-03 00:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1581861, 209023, 37234, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks. I like the action you captured here, and the cropping reduced things down to a sort of "minimalist" view of the action. Good stuff.</td>', 'One of my top picks. I like the action you captured here, and the cropping reduced things down to a sort of "minimalist" view of the action. Good stuff.', '2005-08-03 00:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1581870, 209299, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Met the Challenge, barely;  In my opinion, the hose is a tool, the only other possible ''reach'' I can get is the harness, or the hats, possibly the uniforms but getting into semantics there so in my books ''ok pass'' (but it''s too much of a reach).  I have a feeling this will either win or rate very high.  It is a ''nicely composed'' photo and the b/w or sepia? works well.  Criticism;  I would like to see more contrast on the spray and even more definition in the fireys.  May be a little ''blown out'', not sure on that.  Although I mentioned the b/w, given the minimal subjects I wonder how this would have looked in color.<br/>edit; ok - up to 7 from 5 re toolS (definitely more with ''definite'' toolS)</td>', '7 - Met the Challenge, barely;  In my opinion, the hose is a tool, the only other possible ''reach'' I can get is the harness, or the hats, possibly the uniforms but getting into semantics there so in my books ''ok pass'' (but it''s too much of a reach).  I have a feeling this will either win or rate very high.  It is a ''nicely composed'' photo and the b/w or sepia? works well.  Criticism;  I would like to see more contrast on the spray and even more definition in the fireys.  May be a little ''blown out'', not sure on that.  Although I mentioned the b/w, given the minimal subjects I wonder how this would have looked in color.edit; ok - up to 7 from 5 re toolS (definitely more with ''definite'' toolS)', '2005-08-03 00:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
