(1582057, 209439, 37252, '<td valign="top">Okay - now that the challenge is over, here''s a reply to some of the comments.<br/> <br/>This is an AR-15 - I realize it has no scope and is not an actual sniper rifle, but it seemed to have more impact than the 7mm with a scope that I could have used.<br/>As for the 40 Mag ("banana clip") being illegal....it is only illegal to sell them. Those folks who owned one before the ban  were allowed to keep them.<br/>The odd contrast was done purposefully to give it less of a backyard snapshot look - not due to any blown out highlights. The trees actually looked fine.</td>', 'Okay - now that the challenge is over, here''s a reply to some of the comments. This is an AR-15 - I realize it has no scope and is not an actual sniper rifle, but it seemed to have more impact than the 7mm with a scope that I could have used.As for the 40 Mag ("banana clip") being illegal....it is only illegal to sell them. Those folks who owned one before the ban  were allowed to keep them.The odd contrast was done purposefully to give it less of a backyard snapshot look - not due to any blown out highlights. The trees actually looked fine.', '2005-08-03 01:20:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1582058, 209299, 35517, '<td valign="top">CONGRATS,....... absolutely brillant photo.. well done..</td>', 'CONGRATS,....... absolutely brillant photo.. well done..', '2005-08-03 01:20:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1582059, 207217, 37234, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on getting people to like a picture of something they actually really would prefer to avoid. Shows your skill as a photographer, I would say!!</td>', 'Congratulations on getting people to like a picture of something they actually really would prefer to avoid. Shows your skill as a photographer, I would say!!', '2005-08-03 01:20:58.000000', NULL, 0),
