(1582119, 209364, 7743, '<td valign="top">Choice of background is good, exposure is ok though the lighting is harsh probably from the flash.  The composition is a little too tightly cropped though the diagonal placement of the wrenches is a good idea.  More separation between the wrenchs or a slightly different placement to show the number of wrenches better I think could improve the image.  The ends seem too close together.  A wider angle would allow you to space them out more.<br/> <br/>I didn''t vote on this challenge but would probably have given this a 5.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Choice of background is good, exposure is ok though the lighting is harsh probably from the flash.  The composition is a little too tightly cropped though the diagonal placement of the wrenches is a good idea.  More separation between the wrenchs or a slightly different placement to show the number of wrenches better I think could improve the image.  The ends seem too close together.  A wider angle would allow you to space them out more. I didn''t vote on this challenge but would probably have given this a 5. ', '2005-08-03 01:32:27.000000', NULL, 0),
