(1582584, 209589, 23579, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. The DOF adds a lot. I like the effect of the large aperture. I''m going to look into buying a 50mm lens. The only thing I would change is to have a sharper focus on the aces than on the thumb. My eyes first see the aces but then get drawn to the wrinkles on the thumb. But that''s just me being picky.</td>', 'I really like this shot. The DOF adds a lot. I like the effect of the large aperture. I''m going to look into buying a 50mm lens. The only thing I would change is to have a sharper focus on the aces than on the thumb. My eyes first see the aces but then get drawn to the wrinkles on the thumb. But that''s just me being picky.', '2005-08-03 03:59:27.000000', NULL, 0),
