(1582970, 209355, 30364, '<td valign="top">Well ... a beautiful, harmonious image that doesn''t scare me at all!  (A nice surprise)  You''re right about the light; it''s like a quiet musical counterpoint to the dramatic chords below.  Sort of right hand and left hand.  The diagonal thing is a master compositional touch &amp; I''m surprised no-one has commented on it (alas I cannot identify dressage training equipment - I suppose it''s not really called the "thing", unless it''s by the horse).</td>', 'Well ... a beautiful, harmonious image that doesn''t scare me at all!  (A nice surprise)  You''re right about the light; it''s like a quiet musical counterpoint to the dramatic chords below.  Sort of right hand and left hand.  The diagonal thing is a master compositional touch & I''m surprised no-one has commented on it (alas I cannot identify dressage training equipment - I suppose it''s not really called the "thing", unless it''s by the horse).', '2005-08-03 08:57:09.000000', NULL, 0),
