(1583019, 209660, 29156, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone. - I photographed this one in my garage, with just the next light I could grab (working light from the nearest hardware store) - This camera and flash belonged to my father, he bought it in May 1955 (he gave me also the receipt), so it is 50 years old.  You have to change bulb every time you use the flash....but I only treasure it now.</td>', 'Thanks everyone. - I photographed this one in my garage, with just the next light I could grab (working light from the nearest hardware store) - This camera and flash belonged to my father, he bought it in May 1955 (he gave me also the receipt), so it is 50 years old.  You have to change bulb every time you use the flash....but I only treasure it now.', '2005-08-03 09:27:54.000000', NULL, 0),
