(1585222, 209358, 2158, '<td valign="top">In this case you could have got rid of that hot pixel (more or less) using selective desaturation and darkening the colours you used desat on (green and maybe blue for the little one on the top).  This will only work if you take photos of items that don''t have any green in them however.</td>', 'In this case you could have got rid of that hot pixel (more or less) using selective desaturation and darkening the colours you used desat on (green and maybe blue for the little one on the top).  This will only work if you take photos of items that don''t have any green in them however.', '2005-08-03 22:03:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(1585223, 209349, 20153, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.picdump.org/albums/hslightnin/shuttle_adjust.jpg'', strrpos(''//www.picdump.org/albums/hslightnin/shuttle_adjust.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.picdump.org/albums/hslightnin/shuttle_adjust.jpg"/> <br/>Here it is without the branches<br/>The water was right there so I wasnt able to get closer :(<br/>Thanks for all the comments <br/>Seya</td>', ' Here it is without the branchesThe water was right there so I wasnt able to get closer :(Thanks for all the comments Seya', '2005-08-03 22:03:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1585232, 209349, 26464, '<td valign="top">incredible shot, would have taken 1-3 if not for the branches.. but you know that already :-)<br/> <br/>congrats!<br/></td>', 'incredible shot, would have taken 1-3 if not for the branches.. but you know that already :-) congrats!', '2005-08-03 22:07:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(1585247, 208158, 3214, '<td valign="top">I especially love the context of the clouds and agree that black and white toning with high contrast really works spendidly for this one.  Congrats on your blue!</td>', 'I especially love the context of the clouds and agree that black and white toning with high contrast really works spendidly for this one.  Congrats on your blue!', '2005-08-03 22:16:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1585279, 209535, 41241, '<td valign="top">5th place for this? Its not very good imo.  Its a terrible composition, the whole image is oversharpened and noisy and it just looks boring</td>', '5th place for this? Its not very good imo.  Its a terrible composition, the whole image is oversharpened and noisy and it just looks boring', '2005-08-03 22:37:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(1585283, 209535, 41241, '<td valign="top">The whole voting system on this site makes little sense.  76 people gave it a 6.  The average is clearly 6.  How it finished 5th seems totally odd.  How can anyone give it a 10? And equally how can anyone give it a 4? Its an average shot at best, it offers nothing of interest and is an obvious "oh its a man with tools" Its so unimaginative.  I guess this site isnt very artistic based.</td>', 'The whole voting system on this site makes little sense.  76 people gave it a 6.  The average is clearly 6.  How it finished 5th seems totally odd.  How can anyone give it a 10? And equally how can anyone give it a 4? Its an average shot at best, it offers nothing of interest and is an obvious "oh its a man with tools" Its so unimaginative.  I guess this site isnt very artistic based.', '2005-08-03 22:40:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1585287, 208830, 41241, '<td valign="top">The entire rating system on this website is based on how many 10s you get.  Its totally shocking how some crap photos end up in the top 10.  This should be much higher, not saying this one is crap.  But clearly the script on this site relies on the 10 rating a lot because people with more 10s and less 9s, 8s and 7s get far higher.</td>', 'The entire rating system on this website is based on how many 10s you get.  Its totally shocking how some crap photos end up in the top 10.  This should be much higher, not saying this one is crap.  But clearly the script on this site relies on the 10 rating a lot because people with more 10s and less 9s, 8s and 7s get far higher.', '2005-08-03 22:43:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1585290, 208158, 23456, '<td valign="top">Congratulations ! The choice to use B/W paid off. The detail is amazing !<br/> <br/>-Lisa</td>', 'Congratulations ! The choice to use B/W paid off. The detail is amazing ! -Lisa', '2005-08-03 22:45:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1585306, 209491, 11127, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all those that commented and those that voted. This one was my best score yet. I am slowly improving and I owe that to all that offer advice to novices like myself. Thanks again.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-08-03 21:53:15.</i></td>', 'Thanks to all those that commented and those that voted. This one was my best score yet. I am slowly improving and I owe that to all that offer advice to novices like myself. Thanks again.', '2005-08-03 22:51:26.000000', '2005-08-03 22:53:15.000000', 0),
