(1585505, 209528, 31628, '<td valign="top">Hmm.  Not bad for a first entry.  Make sure you study recent and current challenges.  You will start to develop an eye for composition, which will help you frame your shots.  <br/> <br/>On this one, perhaps the perspective of an ant on these tools might have upped the intrigue.  or maybe some interesting lighting at dusk.  You will learn to flex your imagination to create something unique, but it will take practice.  Keep shooting!</td>', 'Hmm.  Not bad for a first entry.  Make sure you study recent and current challenges.  You will start to develop an eye for composition, which will help you frame your shots.   On this one, perhaps the perspective of an ant on these tools might have upped the intrigue.  or maybe some interesting lighting at dusk.  You will learn to flex your imagination to create something unique, but it will take practice.  Keep shooting!', '2005-08-03 23:49:12.000000', NULL, 0),
