(1585990, 208210, 34100, '<td valign="top">&lt;g&gt; I thought that this looked familiar..<br/>It was taken about 10m from where I took my shot for this challenge, I''d guess!  (the fire-engine was parked outside the industrial museum, for some of the festival saturday).<br/> <br/>I thought this shot deserved to do better than it did, personally.  But then I thought that for your hilarious Metal shot too - at least it lives on in your profile.<br/> <br/>Ed</td>', '<g> I thought that this looked familiar..It was taken about 10m from where I took my shot for this challenge, I''d guess!  (the fire-engine was parked outside the industrial museum, for some of the festival saturday). I thought this shot deserved to do better than it did, personally.  But then I thought that for your hilarious Metal shot too - at least it lives on in your profile. Ed', '2005-08-04 04:57:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(1586104, 208775, 21533, '<td valign="top">This is cool Kelly!  The only thing that perturbs me a little is the contrast between the front and back of the spanner!!  But only a little!<br/>Well done!</td>', 'This is cool Kelly!  The only thing that perturbs me a little is the contrast between the front and back of the spanner!!  But only a little!Well done!', '2005-08-04 08:41:40.000000', NULL, 0),
