(1586746, 208776, 26733, '<td valign="top">If this had a black background it probably would have been a winner. (Or perhaps a stuffed squirel in the picture)</td>', 'If this had a black background it probably would have been a winner. (Or perhaps a stuffed squirel in the picture)', '2005-08-04 13:42:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(1586747, 208776, 28742, '<td valign="top">The bar code is inaccurate. When I scan it it comes up "Stuffed Squirrel" have to subtract a point for that. Also, it looks like there is a big juicy turd under the rake - that makes up for the barcode.<br/> <br/>Overall, I like the border the best.</td>', 'The bar code is inaccurate. When I scan it it comes up "Stuffed Squirrel" have to subtract a point for that. Also, it looks like there is a big juicy turd under the rake - that makes up for the barcode. Overall, I like the border the best.', '2005-08-04 13:43:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1586755, 209535, 25678, '<td valign="top">Well, this a slight effort to bump what''s his face comments down a bit.  Congratualtions on a top five finish.  I love the capture of the mood.  He seems to be intent on his work, yet have great care at the same time.  Cheers!</td>', 'Well, this a slight effort to bump what''s his face comments down a bit.  Congratualtions on a top five finish.  I love the capture of the mood.  He seems to be intent on his work, yet have great care at the same time.  Cheers!', '2005-08-04 13:50:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1586869, 208775, 19708, '<td valign="top">I forgot this:<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//img.photobucket.com/albums/v655/rrclimber/smilies/bananaWrench.gif'', strrpos(''//img.photobucket.com/albums/v655/rrclimber/smilies/bananaWrench.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//img.photobucket.com/albums/v655/rrclimber/smilies/bananaWrench.gif"/> <br/> <br/>Happy Banana Wrench Award....</td>', 'I forgot this:  Happy Banana Wrench Award....', '2005-08-04 14:51:39.000000', NULL, 0),
