(1599606, 209136, 39684, '<td valign="top">I have no business critiquing anyone, but I will try to help through what I believe the majority saw. The lights are a little distracting (harsh glare). The challenge was "tools of the trade" and  voters probably didn''t know exactly how this fit. I understand now that I see your description, but at face value, most probably didn''t see a connection. I think it was very original. I tend to like these type of photos better because they make you see things differently. Good job.</td>', 'I have no business critiquing anyone, but I will try to help through what I believe the majority saw. The lights are a little distracting (harsh glare). The challenge was "tools of the trade" and  voters probably didn''t know exactly how this fit. I understand now that I see your description, but at face value, most probably didn''t see a connection. I think it was very original. I tend to like these type of photos better because they make you see things differently. Good job.', '2005-08-10 02:06:13.000000', NULL, 0),
