(1715511, 209525, 14986, '<td valign="top">A boat on the water can be a great photo with a little creativity.  In my opinion, this one needs a little more interest by changing the composition to a less centered  arrangement,  working a little bit with the levels to boost the contrast and perhaps the color saturation, and nailing the focus just a bit more. (It may just look a little soft due to the lack of contrast.)  I also think it might have more interest if there was some way to bring more attention to the reflection of the boat.  Just my .02 and I hope it is helpful.</td>', 'A boat on the water can be a great photo with a little creativity.  In my opinion, this one needs a little more interest by changing the composition to a less centered  arrangement,  working a little bit with the levels to boost the contrast and perhaps the color saturation, and nailing the focus just a bit more. (It may just look a little soft due to the lack of contrast.)  I also think it might have more interest if there was some way to bring more attention to the reflection of the boat.  Just my .02 and I hope it is helpful.', '2005-09-16 23:58:27.000000', NULL, 0),
