(1742332, 208854, 12253, '<td valign="top">This was very cleverly done!  I think you could make use of this trick again with another theme--this time including all of the saw blade and chosing your setting very carefully, e.g., in front of a landscape or other "lines and shapes" type settings would make a very cool "geometric abstract".  Or even a social commentary, in front of something you think should be "sawed"!</td>', 'This was very cleverly done!  I think you could make use of this trick again with another theme--this time including all of the saw blade and chosing your setting very carefully, e.g., in front of a landscape or other "lines and shapes" type settings would make a very cool "geometric abstract".  Or even a social commentary, in front of something you think should be "sawed"!', '2005-09-27 14:10:55.000000', NULL, 0),
